<VI _name="lvai_latch_switch.vi" description="Make a VI's LATCHED front-panel booleans drivable over VI Server for one run\2C in memory only\2C or put the VI back. Revert FALSE: every top-level Boolean whose Mechanical Action is a latch (3\2C 4\2C 5) gets the matching switch action (0\2C 1\2C 2)\3B Switched lists their labels\2C one per line. Revert TRUE: Revert VI reloads the VI from disk\2C so the change never reaches the file. Value and Value (Signaling) refuse a latched boolean (Error 1193)\3B CLD benchmark builds grafted a whole test copy for it (2026-11-17). Used by lvai_running_vi (start latchedAsSwitch\2C stop).">
